WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,500
Classmate Zhu

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,500
I have washed your clothes. Thank you.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,100
I watched the live broadcast later

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,580
Is your neck okay?

5
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:14,180
When I encountered a sandworm as big as a limb, I guess I went into the water and didn’t hurt any bones.

6
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,500
After lying down in the treatment room for twenty minutes, everything will be fine.

7
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,580
Thanks to the anti-inflammatory medicine you gave me, that'll be fine, right?

8
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,460
I still have your nose, hands and socks here

9
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,900
You don't need the socks. Just keep them and throw them away.

10
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:23,940
sorry

11
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,480
I didn’t expect that I was missing my socks.

12
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,800
It would be nice if I could help

13
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,960
Then let's add a friend, mom

14
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:40,500
I'll add it to a big technology company, that's all.

15
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,420
Freshman training is over

16
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:44,660
The next step is the official class

17
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:46,060
There is a chain of command among you

18
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,780
Mecha Division Individual Soldier Series

19
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:49,430
There is also a logistics department

20
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:51,830
The course schedule for the first day has been sent to your Guangdao Island.

21
00:00:51,830 --> 00:00:55,060
You've seen it all, sir. It's very good.
